   "text": "Lola wanted to play on a team. On Monday, she went to try out for the volleyball team. \"Sorry!\" the coach said. \"You're up there, and the net is down here. You're just too tall!\" Lola was sad. \"They didn't pick me,\" she told her mother and father. \"But I still want to play on a team.\" Lola decided to try out for another team.",
