   "image": "books/G1/101/p09.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 1051,
   "text": "On Saturday, Lola's friends came over. \"Come try out for our team,\" said Jill. \"We need one more player,\" said Mindy. \"We need YOU!\" \"NO!\" said Lola. \"I don't want to try out for the team. The coach won't pick me. I'm just too tall.\"",
